OL,3,GNEWSACaterer went bust 36 hours before
OL,4,Acouple's wedding
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Lorraine and Mark Norwood's
OL,7,Fwedding caterer pulled out less than 36
OL,8,Fhours before their big day, the couple
OL,9,Fwere left in "absolute shock and
OL,10,Fhorror".
OL,12,FIn an email sent just before midnight
OL,13,Fon 1 October this year, their provider,
OL,14,FBaba Ganoush, said they were
OL,15,F"heartbroken" to say they had taken the
OL,16,F"devastating decision to cease trading
OL,17,Fwith immediate effect" and would be
OL,18,Funable to fulfill their commitment.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
