OL,3,GNEWSACaterer went bust 36 hours before
OL,4,Acouple's wedding
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was complete disbelief at first,"
OL,7,FMark said, after they opened the
OL,8,Fmessage on the Friday morning, "then
OL,9,Fshock, then anger that we were let down
OL,10,Fso badly".
OL,12,FWith less than 24 hours to go, and
OL,13,Fhaving already paid #7,000 for a
OL,14,Fthree-course meal and canapes for their
OL,15,F76 guests, they were left scrambling
OL,16,Ffor a replacement.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
